// The app's identity. These defaults build an unsigned simulator app with no
// setup at all. Setup writes app/local.xcconfig (git-ignored) with your own
// values; it is included last, so anything set there wins:
//
//   LIFE_BUNDLE_ID = com.<github-user>.life
//   LIFE_APP_GROUP = group.com.<github-user>.life
//   DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = <10-char Apple team id>
//
// LIFE_BUNDLE_ID    the app's bundle id (the share extension is <id>.share);
//                   ops/hub.json apns_bundle_id must match it
// LIFE_APP_GROUP    the app group the app and the share extension share
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM  your Apple Developer team id (blank = unsigned sim build)
// ops/ota.sh, ops/install-phone.sh and ops/screens.sh read the same values
// (ops/app-identity.sh), so this pair of files is the one place they live.
LIFE_BUNDLE_ID = com.example.life
LIFE_APP_GROUP = group.com.example.life
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =

#include? "local.xcconfig"
